===== PPN-3 residual: abstract.txt companion-artefact lines vs paper
56:  - 13 PARI/GP scripts (~3000 lines) with committed baseline
58:  - 1 Rust integration test (~390 lines) running the full audit on
All scripts are PARI/GP 2.17+ scripts in
\nolinkurl{secp256k1_cm_audit/}. Twelve of the sixteen have a committed
expected output (\texttt{<name>\_output.expected.txt}; for
\texttt{vfcg\_experiment.gp} it is \texttt{vfcg\_output.expected.txt}).
The other four have none. No automated check compares the expected
outputs with fresh runs, and no runtime is recorded.
In addition, a Rust integration test
(\texttt{tests/curve\_audit.rs}, 568 lines at the same commit) runs the audit
via \texttt{cargo test} on every \texttt{CurveParams} constant
